{"id":"vod_hh_26340","vodId":"26340","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠·改","name_cn":"龙珠·改","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第98集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/fa84fbf5d2a071a938062b207cec7693.jpg"},"summary":"许多年前降临在贝吉塔行星上的灾难，无形中改变了整个宇宙的命运。经过最为艰苦的修炼和战斗，孙悟空（野泽雅子 配音）终于赢得天下第一比武大会冠军，和朋友和家人们过上幸福的生活。但是他的战斗并未中止，邪恶无情的手足同胞拉蒂兹、贝吉塔（堀川りょう 配音）、那霸先后造访，之后与曾一手毁灭贝吉塔行星的宇宙最大恶魔弗利萨（中尾隆圣 配音）的宿命决战，再到后来人造人危机以及拥有所有Z战士绝招和不死之身的怪物沙鲁（若本规夫 配音）。宇宙最强战争不断升级，孙悟空和他的朋友们为了全宇宙的和平勇猛冲锋。久违的《龙珠》故事，焕发耀眼夺目的光彩……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 16:57:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":98,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAOoMjd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepVKkyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddwg5KXd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yer75mLa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pdyk59Ra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDEr8kd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel6L21b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penJXrYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQLm0Me/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejJMqYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yer750Ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVZrPBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6VyRLb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKEBZld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZXyV2b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAOoP7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAOon7d/index.m3u8"},{"name"